   "lines": [
    "Drove over to Cambridge",
    "in the morning. Went",
    "in town to see the",
    "girls — Rose, Rosy and",
    "Alice — off to the Glades[?].",
    "They wanted me very",
    "much to go down to",
    "stay a few days with",
    "them; and they were",
    "all so cordial, and",
    "Alice was so bewitching",
    "-ly pretty that it was",
    "frightfully hard to",
    "refuse; I took the",
    "night train for Matta-",
    "-wamkeag[?] however,",
    "as I agreed to meet",
    "Emlen. Dined at the",
    "Union Club with Frank Lee."
   ],
